{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6b760d9a8eeea21fa60c52fc927aec66208bbb284b1044189051e672f0ab8b5a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903c1b425bacda171af5ab5569c41beb3b93c8235d860d6173f537404a33bb66",
      "text": "另一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb1253fc4305bcbbd0b5f080863dc514602884831dc2337ec003e830866142c",
      "text": "那么，大家来各自说说想到的方案吧。\n首先从提议者的我开始可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50868fe8824fe5c8b0f5b341d61270c80a5f4f0b04768ba04bc8d6a0c25e3188",
      "text": "嗯，拜托啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac6d8643fef75ee57bd38abe72833a767b9d18f9f6bddff8d3a601b8c596662",
      "text": "水族馆怎么样？不仅能和许多海洋生物接触，\n还能了解它们的生态！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:397910d729e1c8d0eb3d89530a42f0d94656cb39fcb5012cea57577d32853649",
      "text": "那个留到克里斯先生生日的时候办比较好哦～。\n作为明年的候选吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fdf78ab7976e82f29040f6f2c83cff8409c693e079fb8fa74f4a1158a38ec1a",
      "text": "我明白了。既然如此，海鲜市场怎么样。\n我听说他挺喜欢吃海鲜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9212a823eb969d0a44648abca4ae52f2bcb8ed0c6670582246bdef5966d8314a",
      "text": "那样的话，选一个雨彦先生方便去的地方\n怎么样呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65c5ba40be6a086e41037ddf1bd6dbd191d8d1ad197e686a9f551de44beb8a65",
      "text": "是呢。\n去海鲜市场就留到下次机会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95e475447ac1f0a12437b78ffa7c42d5fdbb3f3da67623f0c95f2d852fe03b1e",
      "text": "难得过一次生日，我们再多想点\n点子出来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
